{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "2bc4e959388fa4e3020a6c4fd1576015268e5d30f80d5680c05563f27efbb6f1", "ja": "ウトウトな夢", "zh": "迷迷糊糊的梦", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fe1f019bc441bcef2fefc59c63ddb9eb449d848b794ae5757bf20d693d026f4e", "ja": "リリースイベントを兼ねた握手会直前、劇場\nの裏に住みついた、環の友達であるネコの\n『こぶん』が逃げ出した。劇場内を捜索する\n環、やよい、可奈。捜索の末、無事に気持ち\nよさそうに眠る『こぶん』を見つける。", "zh": "在发片活动兼握手会开始前，环住在剧场用地\n的猫朋友『小弟』跑进剧场了。环还有弥生、\n可奈便在剧场内四处寻找。最后终于顺利找到\n了看起来睡得很舒服的『小弟』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a6485f25c86cf1ca29d9e8ef616f095b3aa35581f194bb9adcd1c64017926eae", "ja": "（今日は、新曲のリリースイベントも兼ねた\n握手会の日だ）", "zh": "（今天是新歌发片活动\n兼握手会的日子。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "97fce60a338e60e8e3ae4864c712287cbb3552c9c07ab95625fb36d02347467e", "ja": "（育が他の仕事で参加できないのは残念だけど、\n育のためにもいい握手会にしないとな）", "zh": "（虽然育因为其他工作而无法参加，十分可惜，\n但为了育，必须让这场握手会圆满落幕。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "2a50f4d5535cd6fd3840928841fae8277e3abf0c882b84646b94f73b854d5ab7", "ja": "あれっ、こぶん！？\nどうしてこんなところにいるの？", "zh": "奇怪，是小弟！？\n你怎么会在这种地方呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b22df0407db915eb2efb4c02c5379b64d89dbf3530fcb807468f9ac44435b6ad", "ja": "環、どうした……ん？　なんでこんなところに\nネコが……。なんか見覚えがあるような？", "zh": "环，怎么了……嗯？为什么这种地方\n会有猫咪……感觉好像在哪里看过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "32831ea982830b7c16fb0e680e81c30fb9c4ea415cf3dde260926ee6d08dbffa", "ja": "違うよ、これはネコじゃなくて、こぶんだよ！\nおやぶん、忘れちゃったの～？", "zh": "不是啦，这不是猫咪，是小弟啦！\n老大，你忘记了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a98891a11d73706868d8b836568f0581953befe53957b3857b4102e7ed1ba646", "ja": "ん？　ああ、そういえば、そうだったな。\nとっさに見分けが付かなくて……。", "zh": "嗯？哎呀，这么说来确实是呢。\n我一下子认不出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1007_kobun", "source_sha256": "a2a6c4918a88731eabb1888ec0387456a997b40703af04b43f22b8092912b6dd", "ja": "にゃ～♪", "zh": "喵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "d97428691a24f588f0491045374047b34a14725dff185f73595ae37efa298eeb", "ja": "かわいい～！　おいでこぶんちゃん、ニャニャ～ン♪\n可奈と一緒にニャ～ニャ～ニャ～♪", "zh": "好可爱～！过来呀小弟，喵喵～♪\n和可奈一起喵～喵～喵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "f9f0c0ef904c65b374486e53e8c28513bca555ec1c5d347e2588ff2a08ef0b4f", "ja": "あ、たしか劇場の近くでよく見かける子だよね？\nこの子、環ちゃんのお友達だったんだ？", "zh": "啊，这是常常出现在剧场附近的猫咪吧？\n原来牠是小环的朋友呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "54ac0d90a0984d553a97a5a2b47df8537453bb012e5f108b5de8668f8f117233", "ja": "うん！　たまきとこぶんはソーゼツな戦いをして、\n友達になったんだぞ！", "zh": "嗯！环和小弟打了壮烈的一战，\n就变成好朋友了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3187536f50d3dc37053ebf6f61c6c6af2e2a9fd5c1ea5cf1004ac2ba47cc41d4", "ja": "（そんな過去があったのか……）", "zh": "（原来有这种往事啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1012_kobun", "source_sha256": "33ae1250681a6e8ce8593a150aca35f5c4f5a37c4febd79807b1194c4b6c38a9", "ja": "にゃ～にゃ～♪", "zh": "喵～喵～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8ef3c5981717d95a63c59801ffd7695da766ffa916f68a863f4e5fcb5d2336ba", "ja": "おお、なんだなんだ？　突然すり寄ってきて……。", "zh": "喔喔，怎么了怎么了？怎么突然靠过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1014_005yay", "source_sha256": "49d25f7bc3c2b9116c0aa0c0178cb99e70e01aeaeb82886bafb6e150dd6314a0", "ja": "あ、{$P$}が懐かれてますー！\nえへへ、仲よしですね！", "zh": "啊，牠在跟{$P$}撒娇──！\n嘿嘿，你们感情真好呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "cd56cfe3bb20486adfa023da5bfe630eb266204d07490501c79b4ec2bc7b3f64", "ja": "いいな～。私も足元、スリスリされたいな～。", "zh": "真好～我也好想被磨蹭脚边喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "35a4376413f1730c55678c77589e90df1974d89db8e626af54b0137bba1aebd9", "ja": "わぁ、さすがおやぶん！　こぶんをあっという間に\nこぶんにするなんて、すごいぞ！", "zh": "哇，不愧是老大！竟然一下子就把小弟\n收为小弟，好厉害喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1017_040tam", "source_sha256": "34120b76dc6b7526a8b2728f776044f34ed3fc06205a37c6d53095f1a0ef9e17", "ja": "これでおやぶんは、こぶんのおやぶん……じゃなくて、\nおおおやぶんだね！", "zh": "这样一来老大就是小弟的老大……不对，\n大老大才对呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1018_p", "source_sha256": "91642459bf95a87168f2a279d285005e0a4e37f0340c94e1dcb297bf21b1c8e4", "ja": "そ、そうなのか。はは、よろしくな、こぶん。\nでもそろそろお客さんも来るし、一旦家に戻って……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗？哈哈，请多指教了，小弟。\n但客人差不多要来了，还是先回去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1019_kobun", "source_sha256": "d0ec4d09efe970e47635b39ff409c5b1b5bb50cbd6fc92556c6e265da5e42c91", "ja": "……にゃっ！", "zh": "……喵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1020_005yay", "source_sha256": "4ddb471b276200bb825f651940f9beecf80e28f0974cba3f66b0e872f9f2f61b", "ja": "はわっ！？　劇場の奥に走っていっちゃいましたー！", "zh": "哇哇！？牠跑进剧场里了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1021_040tam", "source_sha256": "aa4b796f312ae1a16303659f8f486913033880ecd5bdeac97546911e1ffa4823", "ja": "わぁ！　こぶん～、どこに行くの～！？", "zh": "哇！小弟～你要去哪里～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "bbdc66297d0a527ae977539f4df9258f3a24eb3383f49d979c8a95c8a1b5d47d", "ja": "あっ、環ちゃんまで……！\n{$P$}さん、早く追いかけなきゃっ！", "zh": "啊，连小环都……！\n{$P$}先生，得赶快追上去才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_1023", "source_sha256": "d3a3d7ea51e8defcd01039c41897a01c31084c93e4ec638b155f4220a7fe965d", "ja": "大丈夫！", "zh": "没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2000_p", "source_sha256": "757eea3f3ad6d174cd1ce066e22fcb32eac2a5dfda2c3e8d934d86cf7a06d168", "ja": "ふたりとも、落ち着いて。劇場の中なら行ける場所は\n決まってる。ひとつひとつ部屋を手分けして探そう。", "zh": "你们两个都先冷静，剧场里能去的地方很有限，\n我们分头一间一间找吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2001_005yay", "source_sha256": "b0222380e4b02d122b1b388d5ad080aa8a86d6c0cc9ca8ff17c454c9f77fae41", "ja": "は、はいっ、わかりましたー！", "zh": "好、好的，明白了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2002_p", "source_sha256": "9fd0b8547f4feaf5e0c847bb759021c5818c6ae3dbd98de066a2f6f97af96196", "ja": "ここにはいない、と。\nあと、探してない部屋は……。", "zh": "这里也没有。\n剩下还没找的房间是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2003_005yay", "source_sha256": "d509113bea0230ba40c89cedb2e12e4d59758210c00598ee21213991fbe9996b", "ja": "{$P$}！\n環ちゃんとこぶんちゃん、給湯室にいましたー！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n小环和小弟在茶水间──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2004_p", "source_sha256": "2f08c04aa91076944b40bf7c56a30f4417bdd1812e550503ee7cfe7e4a5bd2a4", "ja": "給湯室に？\nわかった、行こう！", "zh": "在茶水间？\n我知道了，走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2005_p", "source_sha256": "5d4ea6c267a769b7fd0e2ad1d449a14ac0eb6bf817311620ecba942facf5a1f4", "ja": "環、いるかー？\nそろそろ握手会が……。", "zh": "环，你在吗──？\n握手会差不多要开始了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2006_040tam", "source_sha256": "53b79316cc584dca571280b2ab1f9c2945d1e13e0e34fbc263be36a9e7899d64", "ja": "おやぶん、しっ～！\n大きな声出すと、起きちゃうぞ！", "zh": "老大，嘘～！\n太大声会吵醒牠的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2007_p", "source_sha256": "1b68f3c1f5f622be16aa535b715c75ee6bf187594b12c169b4e7f39df9201c2c", "ja": "起きちゃう？\n……あ、こぶん、寝ちゃったのか。", "zh": "吵醒？\n……啊，小弟睡着了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2009_005yay", "source_sha256": "d942bec38f9ce74377cd566fc5c90fd728bf1b1ed4e44756909108ceb82c7717", "ja": "ぐっすり寝てますね。\nえへへ、かわいいですー♪", "zh": "睡得很熟呢，\n嘿嘿，真可爱──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2010_036kan", "source_sha256": "aef1cccd5986ea8ce7ad2b44c0115f1be964489e49c2abc60eb1c540c0422cfb", "ja": "ほんとだね～♪\nいったい、どんな夢を見てるのかな～？", "zh": "真的耶～♪\n牠到底在做什么梦呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2011_040tam", "source_sha256": "3242153687deabbff514900822f3c3cf26930a2e3b5fd45f58fa8a051ea81ba6", "ja": "きっといい夢だよっ！\nだって、こんなに気持ちよさそうに眠ってるもん。", "zh": "一定是个美梦！\n因为牠看起来睡得这么舒服嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2012_p", "source_sha256": "858ff78b7166e0b346e7eb4795a5f2d14f6a1da90779a918fa87e800aa6ff9bf", "ja": "そっとしておいてやろう。\nそれより、そろそろ握手会の時間だぞ。", "zh": "先别管牠了吧。\n更重要的是，差不多要到握手会的时间了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2014_036kan", "source_sha256": "5dcf775c47663e4b8fb5345f317b34e409a3311e247dddde8b9a08ccaf154e00", "ja": "あっ、大変～！\n早くエントランスに戻らなきゃ！", "zh": "啊，不好了～！\n得赶快回到大厅才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2015_040tam", "source_sha256": "f07604c07f0f94593dce536e03a92627705725a03a4a7a024b911399f761e3ec", "ja": "忘れてた、早く戻らないと……あっ、でも、\n起きた時ひとりだったら、こぶん、さびしくないかな？", "zh": "都忘记了，要赶快回去……啊，但是，\n如果醒来的时候孤伶伶的，小弟会不会寂寞呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_2016", "source_sha256": "d3a3d7ea51e8defcd01039c41897a01c31084c93e4ec638b155f4220a7fe965d", "ja": "大丈夫！", "zh": "没问题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_3000_p", "source_sha256": "310796419e761e29c05d1afe391ce06537da0a083c0627ba3e7e137297418666", "ja": "大丈夫、みんなが握手会をしてる間は、\n俺がちょくちょくこぶんを見に来るから。", "zh": "没问题，大家在办握手会的时候，\n我会抽空来看小弟的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_3001_040tam", "source_sha256": "b7c7d5ccfd33e1ae7aa78c08d78d7bcb942b6d4fa751091429a90843946afd70", "ja": "わぁ！　それなら、こぶん、ひとりじゃないね！\nおやぶん、ありがと～！", "zh": "哇！那小弟就不会孤单了！\n老大，谢谢你～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_3002_005yay", "source_sha256": "50e987020d42cfe0e650e5236c342c5864f516f9fce79939037024a49a7700c2", "ja": "環ちゃん、よかったね。それじゃあ、\n{$P$}、行ってきますー！", "zh": "真是太好了呢，小环。\n那{$P$}，我们走吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_3003_p", "source_sha256": "3ea3cedf2652448d19db1cfe807740985e78260948d7cbc1bb914ff340b4b945", "ja": "（その後の握手会では、みんな、\nいつもよりリラックスできていたようだ）", "zh": "（接下来的握手会，\n大家似乎都比平常更加放松。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0007_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_03_3004_p", "source_sha256": "b372635ee355ec4a77c7e6a83c840423a69abfe7e078b43e743c557f2b6f3806", "ja": "（こぶんのおかげで、緊張する暇がなかったからかな。\n後でお礼にキャットフードを買ってやろうか）", "zh": "（可能是多亏了小弟，让大家没空紧张吧。\n之后买个猫食来答谢牠吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
